==Battleground==
*1 [[King Wahwah]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Daboo of the Dead]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

